  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add sausage and cook until browned, about 3 minutes. Remove and set aside.",
    "Add onion and ginger to the pan and cook until the onion is translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add curry paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add cumin, coriander, turmeric, and salt. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add shrimp and cook until pink and cooked through, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Return sausage to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Simmer for 2-3 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Serve over rice or with naan bread."
